OL,3,GNEWSACity Hall clock tower could be
OL,4,Aopened to the public
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a revamp of City Hall in
OL,7,FNorwich, which could see the landmark's
OL,8,Fclock tower opened to the public, have
OL,9,Fbeen submitted by the city council.
OL,11,FThe Grade II* listed building has been
OL,12,Fa focal point of the city for nearly 90
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,FThe upgrade will aim to cut the local
OL,16,Fauthority's annual upkeep costs, which
OL,17,Fare about #2m because of ongoing repair
OL,18,Fwork and inefficient heating systems.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
