OL,3,GNEWSACity Hall clock tower could be
OL,4,Aopened to the public
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Galvin, the Green Party council
OL,7,Fleader, said she could not put a figure
OL,8,Fon the cost of the project but said it
OL,9,Fwould be a "substantial investment".
